{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2023-04-10 07:30:00', 'title': 'EQT AND WHEELING PARK COMMISSION LAUNCH FORESTRY MANAGEMENT PROGRAM AT OGLEBAY', 'text': "PITTSBURGH , APRIL 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQT CORPORATION (NYSE: EQT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S FIRST NATURE-BASED CARBON OFFSET INITIATIVE. EQT HAS PARTNERED WITH THE WHEELING PARK COMMISSION, TERALYTIC, A SOIL ANALYTICS COMPANY, AND CLIMATE SMART ENVIRONMENTAL CONSULTING, LLC, TO IMPLEMENT FOREST MANAGEMENT PROJECTS THAT WILL GENERATE CARBON OFFSETS."}